{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273353-still-a-little-confused-on-paths","id":1273353,"title":"Still a little confused on Paths","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-07T17:35:07-08:00","id":1273353,"title":"Still a little confused on Paths","content":"Ok, I THINK I have it, but I want to check.<br /> <br /> Each of my 3 paths should have an associated: Group, Access, and Contacts with dots equal to my path rating.<br /> <br /> So, I should have 3 paths, 3 groups, 3 Accesses, and at least 3 Contacts, with the contacts dots totaling the same as my path dots. Correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T14:11:31-08:00","id":1273629,"title":"","content":"Each contact would have dots equal to the rating of the path that contact is from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24507-baladain","name":"Baladain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T03:50:47-08:00","id":1273862,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baladain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273353-still-a-little-confused-on-paths?p=1273629#post1273629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Each contact would have dots equal to the rating of the path that contact is from.</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand it to be different:<br /> <br /> p. 40:<br /> A character gains a number of points to use to create her Contacts as she has dots in her Path. She can spend these dots on either gaining additional Contacts, or making a single Contact better.<br /> <br /> So you have to split up your path dots among the number of contacts you choose to have for that path.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3122-shuragil","name":"shuragil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T21:02:27-08:00","id":1276004,"title":"","content":"I must say, even though there's inconsistent language and it's a little shy on examples, I am very much liking the Path system for both ease of collaboration towards world-building and a mechanic that is credibly self-limiting with the suspension and revoked components. Very elegant - well done! I am looking forward to seeing how this plays out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23804-uri-meca","name":"Uri Meca","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}